After tireless months of playing (weeks with this character), Steve-V (boring
name, I know) ascended to demigoddesshood.
For the most part the game was pretty unremarkable, so I'll spare anyone
reading this the gory details (except to say that carrying a few amulets of
lifesaving into the astral plane was a good idea). I made it out withou
backups or wishing for artifacts. I did polypile a little bit, but didn't get
anything useful (when is an abuse not an abuse?).
Final stats: 25/18/18/15/15/11 with 5,853,726 points (and a whole truckload
of gems). Had all the non-harmful intrinsics except telepathy, which a shade
stole from me down in Ghennom and I didn't bother to reclaim.
Notable kills: Asmodeus, Jubilex, (Orcus was peaceful and I bribed Baalzebub),
Wizard of Yendor (22 times), the high priest (who's that?), Death (6 times),
Pestilence (3 times) - never ran into famine, 63 dragons of assorted
colors. All told, 2752 monsters (but no Archons - never did run into one).

Time to try it with a new character. Maybe a priest.



